 | `TF_FLASHNEXT_GDN_SPLIT` | Exactly `0` or `1`; default off. `1` runs a fused prompt pass's DeltaNet chain over two blocks a value head when the device has an SM for each block, with the same bits |
 | `TF_FLASHNEXT_OWNER_SLOTS` | Exactly `0` or `1`; default off. `1`: a `--tp 2` prompt pass over 64 rows outside a capture sends each rank only the half rows of the slots it owns, with the same bits; both ranks must agree |
